 "why_primary": "S2 rejected Ruiz-Garcia+2024 as primary on circularity: that catalogue derives R_CR from PHANGS-ALMA CO, the same tracer entering S2's phase statistic. This table carries THREE independent TW pattern speeds per galaxy - OM_P_ALMA (CO), OM_P_MUSE_MASS (stellar mass) and OM_P_MUSE_HA (H-alpha). OM_P_MUSE_MASS is a STELLAR tracer and is therefore free of the CO circularity S2 objected to.",
