 "flags_for_the_thread": [
  "All 8 of S2's fixed-order galaxies are present in the table - none missing.",
  "Quality is NOT uniform across tracers. On the stellar (MUSE_MASS) tracer that S2 needs, NGC4321 has QUAL=4 (worst) and NGC4535, NGC1566, NGC5068 have QUAL=3. Only NGC3351, NGC1672 and NGC4303 are QUAL=1 on the stellar tracer. Selecting on the clean tracer therefore costs quality on 4 of the 8.",
  "The three tracers disagree substantially for several galaxies - e.g. NGC1566 ALMA 58.47 vs MUSE_MASS 29.40 (factor ~2), NGC3351 ALMA 60.51 vs MUSE_MASS 43.61 vs MUSE_HA 89.67. The tracer choice is therefore outcome-relevant, not cosmetic.",
  "Errors are asymmetric; both directions are carried in the CSVs."
 ],
